# Never commit footage, renders or anyone's media: the repo ships only our own files.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
out/
renders/
# Gameplay clips fetched from the Algrow GTA library (gameplay.mjs fetch), in any project folder
